{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10381","headline":"同马太守听九思法师讲金刚经 · 高适","name":"同马太守听九思法师讲金刚经","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾师晋阳宝，杰出山河最。\n途经世谛间，心到空王外。\n鸣钟山虎伏，说法天龙会。\n了义同建瓴，梵法若吹籁。\n深知亿劫苦，善喻恒沙大。\n舍施割肌肤，攀缘去亲爱。\n招提何清净，良牧驻轻盖。\n露冕衆香中，临人觉苑内。\n心持佛印久，标割魔军退。\n愿开初地因，永奉弥天对。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}